== Walkthrough ==

You can give Soonog in the Greenblood guild 4 [[lizard meat]] for a rusty two handed sword.

You say, 'Hail, Soonog'

: Soonog says 'You [Greenblood]?'

You say, 'Me Greenblood'

: Soonog says 'Gud. you go kill da lizzies in da Feerrott. Bring Soonog four of dere meatses. Soonog give you gud sword to bash more lizzies wif.'

'''You hand the four lizardmen tails to Soonog:'''

: Soonog says, "Mmm Lizzie meat!! Here, go bash dem lizzies more better wif dis."

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Clurg]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Green Blood Knights]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Storm Guard]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Shadowknights of Night Keep]] got worse.
</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}.

